+/**
+ * Select the configured local or S3 appraisal artifact listing.
+ *
+ * Local mode recursively streams folio-named ZIP files and never calls AWS.
+ * S3 mode preserves the existing flat `transformed_output.zip` listing path.
+ *
+ * @param options - Bulk-loader appraisal source options.
+ * @param s3 - Existing S3 client used only when no local directory is configured.
